{# « Désactiver le compte » (design/validated/account-management.md §7.4, mockup 4).

   It replaces the confirm() this button carried until 2026-08-24, and the reason is not taste: the
   scope of the gesture changed that day. It no longer stops at MonCampus - the directory account is
   closed within the minute, so the school's workstations close too - and a confirm() can show one
   sentence.

   Four points and a note, in that order, because the two questions an administrator actually has
   are "what does this close" and "what does this destroy". The answer to the second is nothing. #}
<div class="modal fade" id="deactivate-account-modal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="deactivate-account-modal-title">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h2 class="modal-title" id="deactivate-account-modal-title">{{ 'userDeactivateModalTitle'|trans({'%name%': editedUser.displayName ?? editedUser.username}) }}</h2>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="{{ 'cancelAction'|trans }}"></button>
            </div>

            <div class="modal-body">
                <ul class="cm-conseq">
                    <li><span class="cm-conseq__mark">→</span><span>{{ 'userDeactivateConsequenceAccessHtml'|trans|raw }}</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cm-conseq__mark">→</span><span>{{ 'userDeactivateConsequenceDirectoryHtml'|trans|raw }}</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cm-conseq__mark">→</span><span>{{ 'userDeactivateConsequenceNothingErasedHtml'|trans|raw }}</span></li>
                    <li><span class="cm-conseq__mark">→</span><span>{{ 'userDeactivateConsequenceReversibleHtml'|trans|raw }}</span></li>
                </ul>

                <div class="cm-callout cm-callout--info mt-3">
                    <p>{{ 'userDeactivateMailboxNoticeHtml'|trans|raw }}</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="cm-btn" data-bs-dismiss="modal">{{ 'cancelAction'|trans }}</button>
                <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_directory_users_deactivate', {id: editedUser.id}) }}">
                    <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('directory_user_deactivate') }}">
                    <button type="submit" class="cm-btn cm-btn--danger">{{ 'userDeactivateButtonLabel'|trans }}</button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
